                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2cdb703a-aacf-3f7a-9cc8-2658f0d247f8",
                        "entry_id": "f7a0a951-8e10-3d1f-8743-dfcf8f44826b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "состояние по значению прил. причастный непосредственное отношение, касательство кого-либо к чему-либо, вовлечённость кого-либо во что-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2be4275f-c5b0-45e2-af72-f6c38f832d16",
                                "sense_id": "2cdb703a-aacf-3f7a-9cc8-2658f0d247f8",
                                "text": "Ответственные за расследование отравления Скрипалей британские силовики признали, что за четыре месяца так и не смогли получить улики, доказывающие причастность России и руководства страны к этому происшествию."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8df0d06e-4184-4e8b-afeb-eeb15e7d10d0",
                        "source_entry_id": "f7a0a951-8e10-3d1f-8743-dfcf8f44826b",
                        "source_sense_id": "2cdb703a-aacf-3f7a-9cc8-2658f0d247f8",
                        "target_lang_word": "involvement",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "involvement",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "893ad553-fb6b-3867-851c-3326409895c9",
                                        "entry_id": "5ff12934-3f1d-3844-8b6c-eb7533123124",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of involving, or the state of being involved."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a5ed4a6-7ee9-45d1-b9d6-3a0f0b178638",
                                                "sense_id": "893ad553-fb6b-3867-851c-3326409895c9",
                                                "text": "His colorful life span might be regarded as the story of an adventurer rather than that of an artist; despite his lengthy involvements in many of the arts--painting, fiction, theater, and film--one often feels from his autobiography that it was the adventures that counted most for him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "627bcea7-7e50-4980-80db-d1f575ed9f06",
                        "source_entry_id": "f7a0a951-8e10-3d1f-8743-dfcf8f44826b",
                        "source_sense_id": "2cdb703a-aacf-3f7a-9cc8-2658f0d247f8",
                        "target_lang_word": "participation",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "participation",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2f49f51c-d539-3a79-a099-7c93cf35c223",
                                        "entry_id": "23620ac4-56e7-3f98-b45e-135c072b6b16",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action de participer à quelque chose."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5e54133-93f8-4694-bdbf-c1379b9b10b4",
                                                "sense_id": "2f49f51c-d539-3a79-a099-7c93cf35c223",
                                                "text": "Cela veut précisément dire que des participations ne sont pas réalisées et que des non-participations, en revanche, sont manifestes et déterminantes pour l’objet considéré."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73086d75-511a-4da9-98ea-c3884bc89b17",
                                                "sense_id": "2f49f51c-d539-3a79-a099-7c93cf35c223",
                                                "text": "Ainsi, même le musicien qui recevait un cachet pour sa participation au bal de la rosière de Trifouilly les Oies, cotisait à la CARBALAS avec son employeur d'un jour."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d3777ab-e688-4df0-9622-e2383cd952f6",
                                                "sense_id": "2f49f51c-d539-3a79-a099-7c93cf35c223",
                                                "text": "Cela s’est fait sans ma participation, sans sa participation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e6d4c1d0-6449-3af4-b80c-92985c76b3dd",
                                        "entry_id": "23620ac4-56e7-3f98-b45e-135c072b6b16",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Partage entre propriétaires et salariés (entre ceux-ci, au prorata de leurs salaires) de la partie des bénéfices dépassant une rémunération donnée des capitaux propres."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Économie"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
